# No PWM, on the configsettings page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "no_pwm").
# Speed click on it: on/off, and back to the instrument. On: the file (next)
# and freeze LEDs are only fully on or off, without PWM (their PWM is heard
# in the audio). Saved (configsettings.py).
# Slot LED bright = on (nebulae-status).
